update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Client responsibilities and activities should include: | a) determining the need for the assessment; | b) defining the terms and objectives of the assessment (see 5.3.2); | c) determining the scope (see 5.3.3) and assessment criteria (see 5.3.4); | d) selecting the assessor(s); — printed p.6 (PDF p.16)', verification_note='VA-verified 2026-09-08 (§5.2.2 a)-d) of the printed a)-m) list, printed p.6 (PDF p.16) — quote trimmed to the first four items for length; items e)-m) continue on printed pp.6-7 and are not contradicted) [VA · BS EN ISO 14015:2022 published (identical to ISO 14015:2022, 2nd edition), PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='1d870459-aa93-40b4-a230-1f5f4226781a' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- assessee_access_provided
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The responsibilities of the representative of the assessee should include: | a) providing access to relevant areas and information to meet the objectives of the assessment; | b) informing relevant employees and other parties about the assessment process; | c) providing, or assisting to provide, personnel for interviews; | d) providing personnel to assist in the assessment process, if requested; | e) providing a safe workplace for the assessor. — printed p.7 (PDF p.17)', verification_note='VA-verified 2026-09-08 (§5.2.3 a)-e), printed p.7 (PDF p.17) — is_required=false is CORRECT here: the same subclause states "The role of the representative of the assessee does not apply if the assessment is undertaken without the knowledge of the assessee, or if the asset is one for which no responsible party can be identified.") [VA · BS EN ISO 14015:2022 published (identical to ISO 14015:2022, 2nd edition), PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='708e494a-8329-4d3d-ade9-7fd8ce29e607' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- party_role
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='This document covers the roles and responsibilities of the parties to the assessment (the client, the assessor and the representative of the assessee), and the stages of the assessment process (planning, information gathering, verification and/or validation, evaluation, and reporting). | The roles and responsibilities of an assessment provider are distinct from those of an assessor. — printed pp.vi, 8 (PDF pp.8, 18)', verification_note='VA-verified 2026-09-08 (§0.2 + §5.2.5, printed pp.vi, 8 (PDF pp.8, 18) — the four enum values are exactly the four parties given their own subclause: client §5.2.2, representative of the assessee §5.2.3, assessor §5.2.4, assessment provider §5.2.5. The §0.2 sentence names only the first three; the fourth is added by §5.2.5, hence the joined quote) [VA · BS EN ISO 14015:2022 published (identical to ISO 14015:2022, 2nd edition), PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='c5bb3d12-0349-438c-9b0f-4dfaff1176bb' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
