update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Criteria may include, but are not limited to: | currently applicable and reasonably foreseeable legal requirements (e.g. consents, permits, environmental laws and regulations and regulatory policies); | other client environmental requirements established (e.g. organizational policies and procedures, specific environmental conditions, management practices, systems and performance requirements, industry and professional codes of practice and conduct); | technological requirements; | environmental issues established as material by the organization and its interested parties. — printed p.10 (PDF p.20)', verification_note='VA-verified 2026-09-08 (§5.3.4, printed p.10 (PDF p.20) — FINDING: the printed list is EXPLICITLY OPEN ("may include, but are not limited to"), yet the encoded enum closes it at five values. An engineer with a sixth, legitimate criterion category has no way to record it. Open-list widening is STAGED, not applied) [VA · BS EN ISO 14015:2022 published (identical to ISO 14015:2022, 2nd edition), PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='de7026ac-7ab6-4f6f-b0c8-91c80e4cb042' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
