update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The assessor(s) should select and determine the methods to be used for effectively and efficiently gathering information for the EDD, depending on the specified objectives, scope and criteria. | Examples of methods that can be used for gathering information are as follows: | questionnaires, surveys and checklists; | personal interviews; | documentation review; | observation; | focus group discussions. — printed p.11 (PDF p.21)', verification_note='VA-verified 2026-09-08 (§5.3.6, printed p.11 (PDF p.21) — FINDING: the five enum values are the five printed items, but the printed list is introduced as "Examples of methods that can be used", i.e. exemplary and open; the enum closes it. Gate CR-016 further makes this optional (is_required=false) field mandatory via IS NOT NULL. Both STAGED) [VA · BS EN ISO 14015:2022 published (identical to ISO 14015:2022, 2nd edition), PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='14fb098a-77de-4278-987f-3cc17bad372b' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
